    delphi:evidenceAgainst "No simple form is relative to the chosen shape descriptors.", "Finite runs do not exclude eventual regularity." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/wolfram2002-ch05-04--gpt--dataset-1> .
